    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d190">

                <pb facs="0283" n="209" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg209"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Portman.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 20.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-07-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 14, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Herewith I enclose for your information a
                    transcript of an instruction<anchor n="*" xml:id="d190-f1"/> of the 26th ultimo,
                    which was addressed to Mr. Adams, at London, immediately after the receipt of
                    your despatch No. 14, dated the 13th of April last. Mr. <pb facs="0284" n="210"
                        xml:id="pg210"/> Adams has been authorized to receive the quota part of the
                    Japanese indemnity due the United States, and to deposit the same with the
                    Messrs. Barings to the credit of the Secretary of State.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. L C. Portman,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d190-f1" n="*" xml:id="d190-f1-content">
                <p>For enclosure see correspondence with United States minister to Great
                    Britain.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
